(4, 'MD SHAKILUZ ZAMAN', 'shakilgp93@gmail.com', '+971971 56 334 1752', 'career_cvs/SHAKIL_CV_.pdf', 'MD SHAKILUZ ZAMAN\r\nLocation: Dubai, UAE\r\nPhone: +971 56 334 1752\r\nEmail: shakilgp93@gmail.com\r\nDate: August 27, 2026\r\n​Hiring Manager\r\nSkill Mount Electronics Trading LLC - Skill Tech\r\nDubai, United Arab Emirates\r\n​Application for Sales Administrator Position\r\n​Dear Hiring Team,\r\n​I am writing to express my strong interest in the Sales Administrator position at Skill Mount Electronics Trading LLC (Skill Tech). With a robust background in accounts reconciliation, record-keeping, client services, and operational support in Dubai, I offer a well-rounded skillset to streamline your sales operations, manage order processing, and support your commercial team effectively.\r\n​In my recent experience as a Senior Accounts Executive in the UAE and as a banking professional, I have consistently managed high-volume documentation, client account reconciliations, inventory/treasury tracking, and data entry with strict precision. My financial acumen, combined with front-line customer service experience, enables me to bridge the gap between sales teams, logistics, and finance—ensuring seamless processing of quotations, sales orders, invoices, and customer inquiries.\r\n​Key qualifications I bring to Skill Tech include:\r\n​Administrative & Operational Accuracy: Skilled in managing databases, sales logs, invoicing, and cross-departmental record reconciliations to maintain error-free sales workflows.\r\n​Customer & Client Relations: Strong interpersonal and communication skills in English, Bengali, and conversational Hindi to handle client queries, process requests, and maintain vendor rapport across the UAE\'s diverse market.\r\n​Financial & Numerical Proficiency: Holds a Master’s degree in Accounting (MBA), providing advanced capability in tracking sales metrics, ledger updates, and payment follow-ups.\r\n​Immediate Local Availability: Based in Dubai with full readiness to join your operations quickly.\r\n​Skill Tech’s dynamic presence in the electronics trading sector aligns with my dedication to operational efficiency and customer satisfaction. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my administrative expertise can add value to your team.\r\n​Sincerely,\r\n​MD SHAKILUZ ZAMAN', '2026-08-27 17:43:57.868903', 'Dubai', 'Sales admin /Accounts Executive');
