(53, 'Christopher Harmon', 'Emaar Properties', 'reg@emaarprocurement.com', '+97155357791', NULL, 'Level 7, Dubai Hills Business Park Bldg 1', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\n\nEmaar Properties, one of the world\'s most respected and influential real estate developers, renowned for its landmark projects, industry leadership, and unwavering commitment to quality, is pleased to announce the launch of its Vendor and Supplier Enrollment Program.\n\nThis initiative aims to further reinforce our trusted supplier network in support of ongoing and future developments, while upholding the highest standards of operational excellence. We invite your esteemed organization to formally express its interest by responding to this communication.\n\nUpon receiving your confirmation, our Procurement Team will provide the Expression of Interest\n(EOI) package, which includes:\n- Vendor Questionnaire\n- Policy Assessment Letter\n- Application Submission Confirmation\n\nThese documents outline the initial requirements and will assist your organization in evaluating participation in the program. We appreciate your timely response and look forward to the prospect of a mutually beneficial partnership.\n\nBest regards,\n\nChristopher Harmon\nProcurement Supervisor | Contract Management\nEmaar Vendor Community', '2026-08-21 09:50:25.372275'),
