(1408, 'Skill Tech High Speed HDMI CABLE With Ethernet 4K 2K 1080p 30hz Oxygen Free Copper', 'The SH HD28CU Skill Tech High-Speed HDMI Cable with Ethernet is a high-quality multimedia solution designed for exceptional performance. Supporting video resolutions of up to this cable ensures a stunning and immersive viewing experience with content. Available in various lengths from 1 to 8 meters, it offers flexibility for diverse setup requirements. The vibrant blue PVC jacket and gold-plated HDMI connectors not only enhance durability but also provide a sleek aesthetic to your multimedia connections. Constructed with oxygen-free copper conductors, the cable ensures optimal signal transmission. The aluminum foil shielding and an operating temperature of up to 70°C contribute to its reliability, making it suitable for various environmental conditions. Compliant with RoHS and CE standards, the SH HD28CU cable is a reliable choice for those seeking a high-speed HDMI connection with Ethernet capabilities, ideal for both home entertainment systems and professional applications.', '', 1471, 'https://skilltechonline.com/', ''),
(1409, 'Skill Tech High Speed HDMI CABLE With Ethernet 4K 2K 1080p 60hz', 'The SH HD32CS Skill Tech High-Speed HDMI Cable with Ethernet is a reliable and versatile solution for high-quality multimedia connectivity. With a maximum video resolution of up tothis cable ensures a clear and immersive viewing experience, supporting  resolutions at Available in various lengths from  it caters to diverse setup requirements. The vibrant blue PVC jacket and gold-plated HDMI connectors provide durability and a sleek aesthetic to your multimedia connections. Featuring aluminum foil shielding, the cable maintains signal integrity, and its operating temperature of up to  ensures reliable performance in different environmental conditions. Compliant with RoHS and CE standards, the SH HD32CS cable is a trustworthy choice for those seeking a high-speed HDMI connection with Ethernet capabilities, suitable for both home entertainment systems and professional applications.', '', 1472, 'https://skilltechonline.com/', ''),
(1410, 'Skill Tech HDMI CABLE With Ethernet 4K 2K 1080p 60hz Oxygen Free Copper', 'The SH HD36CU is a cutting-edge HDMI cable engineered with Skill Tech\'s advanced technology, delivering exceptional performance for high-definition audio and video transmission. Boasting a model number of SH HD36CU, this HDMI cable supports a variety of resolutions, including up to ensuring a crisp and clear visual experience for content at 60Hz. The cable is available in various lengths, ranging from 1 to 10 meters, providing flexibility to suit different setup requirements.Distinguished by its eye-catching blue color, the cable features a robust construction with a conductor made of high-quality tinned copper, enhancing conductivity and signal integrity. The HDMI connectors, both male and gold-plated, ensure reliable and stable connections, minimizing signal loss. The cable\'s aluminum foil shield offers effective protection against electromagnetic interference, maintaining signal quality for an optimal viewing experience.', '', 1473, 'https://skilltechonline.com/', ''),
(1411, 'Skill Tech High Speed HDMI CABLE With Ethernet 8K 4K 2K 1080p 60hz Oxygen Free Copper', 'Introducing the SH HD48CU, Skill Tech\'s High-Speed HDMI Cable with Ethernet, designed to elevate your audio-visual experience to new heights. With a model number of SH HD48CU, this cable boasts an impressive video resolution of up to delivering stunning clarity and vibrant colors for an immersive viewing experience.Available in cable lengths of this HDMI cable provides flexibility in setting up your entertainment system. The striking blue color adds a touch of style to your cable management. The cable\'s conductor is made of high-quality tinned copper, ensuring efficient signal transmission, and the connectors are plated with gold for enhanced conductivity and durability.', '', 1474, 'https://skilltechonline.com/', ''),
(1424, 'Skill Tech High Speed HD AOC CABLE With Ethernet 4K 2K 1080p 60hz Active Optical HDMI Cable', 'The Skill Tech SH HF2 0AOC is an innovative High-Speed Active Optical HDMI Cable setting new standards for audio and video connectivity. Featuring the model number SH HF2 0AOC this cable ensures exceptional performance with support for various resolutions, including up to providing a stunning visual experience for  and  With lengths ranging from this cable offers extended reach  making it suitable for diverse home entertainment and professional setups.', '', 1487, 'https://skilltechonline.com/', ''),
(1425, 'Skill Tech High Speed HD AOC CABLE With Ethernet 8K 4K 2K 1080p 60hz Active Optical HDMI Cable', 'The SH HF2 1AOC Skill Tech High-Speed HD AOC Cable with Ethernet stands out as a cutting-edge solution for premium multimedia connectivity. This Active Optical HDMI Cable supports remarkable video resolutions of up to 7680 × 4320 @120Hz, delivering an exceptional 8K viewing experience. With cable lengths ranging from 10 to 100 meters, this cable provides flexibility for various setup requirements. The vibrant blue PVC jacket and gold-plated HDMI connectors not only ensure durability but also bring a touch of sophistication to your multimedia connections. The cable\'s advanced Active Optical technology, along with aluminum foil shielding, guarantees optimal signal integrity. Operating seamlessly in environments up to 70°C, and compliant with RoHS and CE standards, the SH HF2 1AOC cable is a reliable and high-performance choice for those seeking an ultra-fast HDMI connection with Ethernet capabilities, suitable for both professional and home entertainment setups.', '', 1488, 'https://skilltechonline.com/', ''),
